notes = "The five actual playable breath types opt in to the delivered public readiness gate and the same table mapped direct constructors together. Actual owner UUID, current ready/breath_type, observed-condition revision and existing owner/phase clocks are bound; no private grant/action UUID is requested. The current Draconic Spirit armoured-T-Rex body still lacks authored per-pose mouth pixels/surface scope, so its optical input remains authentic_mouth_region_not_authored. A head/face centre is not labelled as mouth. Eight other delivered damage-type selections remain unselected art alternatives. Public ready=false retires readiness even without mouth geometry; actual accepted breath firing remains separate. All artwork is unreviewed; this source wiring is unvalidated."
